        "content": "## Email intake\nTurns emails sent to **invoices@** into processed invoices.\n\nn8n receives the email and applies the Gmail labels. The **core service decides** everything else: which emails and attachments to process, the extracted data, the checks and the status, and what a failure means (retried later, or given up). The AI only extracts data; every decision is deterministic code.",
